        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/43580235?u=cae42d5a371dd041072ce6d85a1808de05535be8&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><h2 dir=\"auto\">Description</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Move a Glitch example over to this repo. Some of the code is on the page already, and we have a better <code class=\"notranslate\">requestFullscreen</code> demo on <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/:fullscreen#styling_a_fullscreen_element\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/:fullscreen#styling_a_fullscreen_element</a>. This example combines the two.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://glitch.com/edit/#!/fullscreen-requestfullscreen-demo\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://glitch.com/edit/#!/fullscreen-requestfullscreen-demo</a></p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Helping <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/chrisdavidmills/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/chrisdavidmills\">@chrisdavidmills</a> remove some of the Glitch assets.</p>\n<h2 dir=\"auto\">Related</h2>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3195670409\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/issues/40170\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/mdn/content/pull/40170/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/mdn/content/pull/40170\">#40170</a></li>\n</ul>",
